        "x-connect-family-policy-notes": "Create retains tenant assertion, policy, idle configuration, metadata and roles. Caller membership is included. Stable logical IDs replay current authorized state with the original receipt; changed intent conflicts. Close expected_revision and reasons are checked inside the mutation after replay lookup. Close refuses unfinished or unknown sessions/calls/SIP/transitions. List includes only live member conversations, supports tenant/participant/identity/state/since/until, defaults open, and caps count100, encoded page384KiB and126 canonical facts. No omitted private counts are exposed. Idle policy writes journal facts atomically and never fabricates media termination.",
        "x-connect-current-application-reference": "openapi-application-http.json#/paths/~1v1~1operations/post",
        "x-connect-supported-selectors": [],
        "x-connect-retired-selectors": [
          "create",
          "conversations",
          "close"
        ],
        "deprecated": true,
