  "x-connect-original-description": "Fresh candidate state only. Explicitly installed canonical conversation.create/list/close and typed HTTP/native/SDK control share normalized intent, current authority, stable IDs and ledger receipts. Metadata is JCS canonical JSON, <=16KiB/depth16 with safe integers; roles are labels and never credentials. Ephemeral defaults to 60 seconds, bound1..604800; persistent only closes explicitly. List uses current views with a 30-second owner/credential/tenant/scope/filter-bound opaque cursor and fixed row high-water. Pagination is not an immutable conversation snapshot. Closed canonical list/create-replay entries emit opened plus closed facts before list ack. Production signed native client/listener integration and full Gate6 acceptance remain open."
